      "cooked": "<p>In this utterly bizarre one-shot, Wraith, KNYFE, Sky-Scraper, and Setback go to the Block to batle Kismet in a randomized start.</p>\n<p>What makes this so bizarre?&nbsp; That it has been up for nearly a week, and nobody has started a thread about it!&nbsp; I wonder why?&nbsp; Maybe because people don't like randomized starts?&nbsp; Maybe people just don't like Kismet so nobody has played it?&nbsp; Maybe a glitch with the website?&nbsp; Maybe everybody's just busy this week?&nbsp; Who knows?<br>\n<br>\nAs is the case with any randomized start, your mileage will vary.&nbsp; I got a mint at 19/19/21/12, then played again to win with 11/24/25/20.&nbsp; If you can get an Infrared Eyepiece, you can try to avoid some of Kismet's more annoying cards, like Lady Luck and Inconceivable Obstruction; and if IR reveals two annoying cards, a Wrecking Uppercut or Neutralizing Resonator can help.</p>",
